 him a weaker alternative to C. Also we could note that Candidate B also lacks decision quality evidence, and has uncooperative behavior. So C remains best.\n\nThus public message: I agree with others, still recommend C, because D lacks explicit stress resilience and reliability, and his interpersonal concerns outweigh his problem solving. Provide evidence: D responds adequately to unexpected events, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously (some positive), but no explicit stress resilience, no explicit reliability, and has hot temper, know-it-all, moody, loner. Compare to C's 100% reliability, calm in crisis, positive crew atmosphere.\n\nThus vote remains Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
